Falsifies `driver_process_contract::non_volatile_memory_express::proofs::an_accepted_handoff_keeps_its_doorbells_inside_the_mapped_page`.

The defect: `Handoff::unpack` stops refusing a stride above `MAXIMUM_DOORBELL_STRIDE`. A stride the
spec permits and QEMU never reports then computes a doorbell offset outside the one page of BAR0 the
EL0 data plane is mapped, the case the constant exists to prevent.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!((0x1000..0x2000).contains(&off))`.

